# plan spec

---
intent: >
  Re-align the cold-start CLI to the new root contract: brain.aide moves to
  `.aide/config/brain.aide` under the user-owned `.aide/config/` ownership
  boundary (scaffold-once-never-overwritten), the default scaffolded launcher
  becomes `@bitbonsai/mcpvault`, the brain.aide schema collapses to `name` +
  `mcpServerConfig.{command, args}`, the boot reporter's brain status drops
  `invalid-path` (four states only: `ok`, `no-brain-aide`, `no-mcp-entry`,
  `mcp-drift`), and the warning's deferred-categories collapse brain wiring
  into a single combined item. No structural reshuffle — the orchestrator
  pipeline shape stays the same; every change is a path constant, a prose
  string, a test fixture, or an annotation tightening the user-owned
  scaffold-once invariant.
---

